{
  "info": {
    "name": "LearningHub API",
    "description": "LearningHub API Collection - Complete endpoints for Learning Lessons, Courses, Videos, and User Course Progress",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/learninghub",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "your_jwt_token_here",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "your_admin_token_here",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lessonId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "courseId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "videoId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "42",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Variables Setup Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": []
            },
            "description": "## Authentication Setup\n\nAll endpoints require JWT Bearer Token.\n\n### Token Types:\n- **User Token**: `user_id` - Read-only (GET) on most endpoints\n- **Admin Token**: `is_admin: true, admin_id` - Full access (GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE)\n\n### Setup Variables:\n1. Set `baseUrl` to your API base URL\n2. Set `token` for user-level requests\n3. Set `adminToken` for admin-level requests\n\n### Headers for all requests:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {{token}}\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\nFor video uploads use:\n```\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Learning Lessons",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET List All Learning Lessons",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is an array\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has lessons with courses\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('title');",
                  "        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('courses');",
                  "        pm.environment.set(\"lessonId\", jsonData[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons"]
            },
            "description": "## GET /learning-lessons/\n\nReturns a list of all learning lessons with their nested courses.\n\n### Permission: User or Admin\n### Token Type: User Token or Admin Token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Create Learning Lesson (Admin Only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains message and learning_lesson\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('learning_lesson');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.learning_lesson).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"lessonId\", jsonData.learning_lesson.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Introduction to Programming\",\n  \"description\": \"Learn the basics of programming concepts.\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons"]
            },
            "description": "## POST /learning-lessons/\n\nCreate a new learning lesson.\n\n### Permission: Admin Only\n### Token Type: Admin Token\n\n### Request Body Fields:\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| title | string | ✅ Yes | Title of the lesson (max 255 chars) |\n| description | string | ❌ No | Detailed description |\n| is_active | boolean | ❌ No | Defaults to true |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Retrieve Learning Lesson by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has lesson details with courses\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('title');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('courses');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/{{lessonId}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons", "{{lessonId}}"]
            },
            "description": "## GET /learning-lessons/{id}/\n\nRetrieve a single learning lesson by its ID.\n\n### Permission: User or Admin\n### Token Type: User Token or Admin Token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT Full Update Learning Lesson (Admin Only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains updated lesson\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('learning_lesson');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Updated Lesson Title\",\n  \"description\": \"Updated description with more details.\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/{{lessonId}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons", "{{lessonId}}"]
            },
            "description": "## PUT /learning-lessons/{id}/\n\nFully update a learning lesson. All fields must be provided.\n\n### Permission: Admin Only\n### Token Type: Admin Token\n\n### Request Body Fields (All Required for PUT):\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| title | string | Title of the lesson |\n| description | string | Detailed description |\n| is_active | boolean | Visibility status |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Partial Update Learning Lesson (Admin Only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains updated lesson\", function () {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('message');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('learning_lesson');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"is_active\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/{{lessonId}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons", "{{lessonId}}"]
            },
            "description": "## PATCH /learning-lessons/{id}/\n\nPartially update a learning lesson. Only send the fields you want to change.\n\n### Permission: Admin Only\n### Token Type: Admin Token\n\n### Example: Deactivating a lesson"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Learning Lesson (Admin Only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 204 No Content\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/learning-lessons/{{lessonId}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["learning-lessons", "{{lessonId}}"]
            },
            "description": "## DELETE /learning-lessons/{id}/\n\nDelete a learning lesson permanently.\n\n### ⚠️ Warning: \nDeleting a lesson will **cascade-delete** all associated courses and their videos.\n\n### Permission: Admin Only\n### Token Type: Admin Token"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
